<title>USA: May names McNamara CEO of Famous-Barr.</title>
<headline>May names McNamara CEO of Famous-Barr.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>May Department Stores Co said Tuesday it named William McNamara Jr president and chief executive officer of Famous-Barr, its St. Louis-based store division.</p>
<p>He succeeds Richard Bennet III, who has been promoted to president and chief executive officer of its Kaufmann's division in Pittsburgh, the retailer said.</p>
<p>McNamara has been with May for 25 years, most recently as senior vice president and general merchandising manager of its May Merchandising division. The appointment is effective May 1, May said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
